within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.L_AntineoplasticAndImmunomodulatingAgents.L01F_MonoclonalAntibodiesAndAntibodyDrugConjugates.L01FE01_Cetuximab;
model Cetuximab_Pointreau2016_reference
